<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-28T08:12:30.398Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 08:12:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Somali federal forces and U.S. airstrikes have recently killed dozens of al-Shabaab militants in Lower Shabelle, including a strike that killed 60 militants and another that killed 61 militants, while Somali troops eliminated two al-Shabaab logistics operatives in the same region. The Somali president has accused the UAE of financing armed groups, and the parliament speaker has blamed Kenya, Ethiopia and Uganda for colluding with al-Shabaab. The African Union approved a new three-phase plan to reduce its troops in Somalia, warning of a possible al-Shabaab resurgence as foreign forces withdraw. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168874&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE00VjAtMG00ZjlwUWQ5VWRCRVNBekpVVnRKMHlrLXg4dEduM2hYU1Y5OUFBQzdHdTVsNFBIY0hjeW83YVVFa1BJekNNeDRldTdkY2xPVGl6TERXVUk?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5kNXpUczBINW1hMjFsNnhVWGpYZVFjR0FjV1ZwOGU1QmVjLW4wNnE2RnlUNnVxNGttbkU0S0x4NzJsbWhacmE2MG9pcTRzN0IwNGNJQkx4RVYyYnZlTnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE43LVl0bXp0UVl1d19NRDFQdDdFcnFtZTlHOTRRNGtXTlNiNU1vcGg4aGxNbEtyQmFfSTEybzZGTkpBSFhUa3NldVkwZGo1Yld4SC1pZDJQVDJuMGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNbVllODNucGNCa0hJOGtHRFdNVHJlMEpYQm5XRUQ0TThaVFEwcnJweDctTnVhMkpKSmhOWWJEQTBYaF9vSWNjUXhUaXlrYy1GTVNSWC1JekVndG9JV1BaU1J3SF9rdll4Q2VqWlJyRXBxSHliYWlzTlZIaFZWYVkwTVRDQnNXV1lqemxRMUpHOElfeDJZck1yS21IWjRKaXRtYlpUTUh3dEtOUm9kRVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;People Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quo